---
title: Getting started with WeLovePDF
description: Learn how browser-based PDF tools work and why your files stay private.
---

WeLovePDF is a collection of **free PDF tools that run entirely in your browser**. No account, no server upload, no waiting in a queue.

## How it works

1. You open a tool (for example **Merge PDF**).
2. You select or drop files on your device.
3. Processing happens locally using WebAssembly and JavaScript PDF libraries.
4. You download the result — files never leave your computer.

> **Offline-friendly:** Once a tool page is loaded, many operations work without a network connection. We also precache core tool pages for faster repeat visits.

## What you can do

- **Organize** — merge, split, rotate, reorder pages
- **Optimize** — compress, flatten, remove metadata
- **Convert** — PDF ↔ images, Word, Excel, and more
- **Edit & sign** — watermark, annotate, sign, redact
- **Secure** — password-protect, unlock, digital certificates

## Workflows vs single tools

**Workflows** chain multiple steps (for example merge → compress → protect) in one guided screen. **Tools** focus on one job with full control over options.

